  "description": "Root setup.py passes absolute extension source paths to setuptools; issue #2 reports its wheel build rejecting these paths.",
  "trigger": "Build a wheel using setuptools path validation, as reported in issue #2 with Python 3.12 and PyTorch 2.6.",
  "expected_behavior": "Extension source paths supplied through setup() are relative to the setup script directory.",
  "actual_behavior": "The source comprehension calls abspath; setuptools rejects an absolute source path in the reported wheel build.",
